{"sections":[{"slug":"群的外自同构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群的外自同构</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">外自同构群</span></strong> (outer automorphism group) <span lang=\"zh\">为其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的自同构群的</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Out}(G)&amp;:=\r\n\\tau_{\\leq 0}\r\n(\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Grp}}(G) /_{\\mathrm{Ad}} G)\\\\\r\n&amp; =\\tau_{\\leq 0}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}